                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[ <[federated.1vlc5p009xdqd31c1rrel13e3ekf].[none:insulin:nk]>]]></run>
                <run>&#10;Readmission Rate:</run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[ <[federated.1vlc5p009xdqd31c1rrel13e3ekf].[usr:Calculation_2445124790632454:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>&#10;Total Encounters:</run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[ <[federated.1vlc5p009xdqd31c1rrel13e3ekf].[cnt:encounter_id:qk]> ]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>─────────────────────────</run>
                <run>
&quot;Down&quot; = dose reduced at discharge
&quot;Up&quot; = dose increased at discharge  
&quot;Steady&quot; = no change
&quot;No&quot; = insulin not prescribed

Higher rates in &quot;Down&quot; patients may indicate 
premature dose reduction before glycemic stability.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
